| Paragraph | Technical Contribution (Authors' Original Ideas) | Citation-Based Content (Prior Work) |
|-----------|-----------------------------------------------|-------------------------------------|
| 1         | 10%                                           | 90%                                |
| 2         | 30%                                           | 70%                                |

